## ⚙️ How It Works Behind the Scenes

```javascript
// HEADED - in src/support/hooks.ts
const headed = process.env.HEADED === 'true';
this.browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: !headed });

// TAGS - in cucumber.js  
tags: process.env.CUCUMBER_TAGS ?? ''

// WORKERS - in cucumber.js
parallel: parseInt(process.env.CUCUMBER_WORKERS, 10) || 0
```

All connected through `package.json` npm scripts!

