## 🆘 Troubleshooting

**Q: Why is test X not running?**
- Check tag in feature file starts with `@`
- Verify tag expression syntax: `@tag1 and @tag2`

**Q: Is parallel really faster?**
- Yes! 3-4x faster with 4 workers on most systems

**Q: Can I change default values?**
- Yes! Edit `package.json` scripts section

**Q: What if parallel is slow?**
- Reduce workers: `CUCUMBER_WORKERS=2`

